  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mathangi Upendher vs The State Of Telangana on 11 September, 2020 Author: K.Lakshman Bench: K.Lakshman The Hon'Ble Justice K.Lakshman",
    "facts": "This application is filed under Section 482 Cr.P.C., to quash the proceedings in Crime No.105 of 2020 pending on the file of Mahabubabad Rural Police Station. Petitioners herein are A-1 and A-2 in the said crime.",
    "arguments": "2. Sri Laxmaiah Kanchani, learned counsel for the petitioners, would submit that this Court in a batch of Criminal Petitions, vide order dt.27-08-2018, held that the police are incompetent to take cognizance of offences punishable under Sections 54 And 59 (1) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
